o and it was ok we had a lovely day. \\n\\nAnyway I\\u2019ll stop rambling - just I saw this post I made a while ago and needed to share. \\n\\nSending love on a Sunday \\ud83c\\udf08\\ud83c\\udf08\\ud83d\\udc95\\ud83d\\udc95\\ud83e\\udd1e\\ud83e\\udd1e\\n\\n#beyou #lifestooshort #confidence #explorer #autism | I\\u2019ve added some funky beats to this post to divert from my geeky brands post! \\n\\nI\\u2019ll admit - I\\u2019m not always the best at picking own brands (Alpro) etc butttt if you want to reduce your food bills this is an easier way to do it. \\n\\nCould be like an experiment \\ud83e\\uddea \\n\\nAre there any others you\\u2019ve tried / know of that u can add??? \\n\\n#foodies #budgetingtips #supermarket #thisorthat"]	\N	pending	2026-07-15 16:59:26.6284	7ab093fbefe7ba3d5e6534ca2da96f43c67fb7e11b396904b67b7e857926c78b7d1c6c141d2f	Side Hustles UK | Gemma	Side	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Instagram	@helpsavemoney	https://www.instagram.com/helpsavemoney/	94593	P1	副业	Snov | Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果	[Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果]\n达人画像: 职场与生产力\n适配 Dola: ✓\nDola 核心场景: 工作场景【P1】\n推荐内容角度: 展示 Dola 完成信息整理、文案表达、沟通演练和任务拆解，结合英国职场、自由职业或副业场景\n内容证据: Travel is the thing I spend most of my money on! I think it’s really important to expand the mind and learn / understand other cultures.\n\nIt pushes you out of your comfort zone, and creates the best memories I think!! \n\nI would round up all of the things I have learned was trying to travel in the cheapest way possible. \n\nI know I still spend money on travelling but I do like to do it on a budget because that’s how I roll 😂😂😂 and that means more holidays right?!? 🙌🙌🙌\n\n#travelling #solofemaletraveler #cheapholiday #bargainhunter | Life is way too short and tbh I only think you realise this until you’re in your later 30s maybe? 🤔 \n\nNot that I mind- I’m lucky to live in a body and brain 🧠 that has kept me okish 😂 for these past few years and hopefully a few more.\n\nWe’re all chasing perfection, acceptance, popularity, discovery, belonging… what is we stopped chasing and just started being? \nLive within our means, do what makes you happy and not what is deemed the norm. \nStart living in your uncomfort (not a word sorry) zone. \nTake risks and accept things will not always be worth it or be in your comfort zone. \n\nYesterday I got up late. Couldn’t do my routine of going to the shop, went to get millie, was with a human all day talking, couldn’t do most of my food routines, then went out on the evening which is really hard for me to do, and walked far too much for my body. \nBut… I am here. \nI’ve woke up, \nI said yes, \nI didn’t let my autism take over (I’m not saying that lightly btw) \nI pushed and pushed because I want a different experience and I don’t want to be a no person. \nI took my tablets and said to millie what I can and cannot do and it was ok we had a lovely day. \n\nAnyway I’ll stop rambling - just I saw this post I made a while ago and needed to share. \n\nSending love on a Sunday 🌈🌈💕💕🤞🤞\n\n#beyou #lifestooshort #confidence #explorer #autism | I’ve added some funky beats to this post to divert from my geeky brands post! \n\nI’ll admit - I’m not always the best at picking own brands (Alpro) etc butttt if you want to reduce your food bills this is an easier way to do it. \n\nCould be like an experiment 🧪 \n\nAre there any others you’ve tried / know of that u can add??? \n\n#foodies #budgetingtips #supermarket #thisorthat\n语言: 英语\n邮箱状态: 已获取\n邮箱来源: 公开主页简介\n采集状态: 成功\n采集时间: 2026-07-15 19:48:12\n来源链接: https://www.instagram.com/helpsavemoney/	40263689	Dola-UK-KOL-Expansion-150-2026-07-15	["40263689"]	\N	{"id": "7ab093fbefe7ba3d5e6534ca2da96f43c67fb7e11b396904b67b7e857926c78b7d1c6c141d2f", "name": "Side Hustles UK | Gemma", "firstName": "Side", "lastName": null, "source": "copy", "emails": [{"email": "gemclo1@gmail.com", "probability": 99, "smtpStatus": 1, "statusTypeText": "status-ok status-outline", "domainType": "linkedin_email", "jobStatus": "current", "is