77	\N	Lauren Smith | Scottish Gaelic & Lifestyle 🌿	https://www.instagram.com/laurenrhiannon/	hannah@zgadigital.com	113496	英国	生活方式	["I\\u2019m guilty of feeling as though I have failed summer because I\\u2019m not abroad, by a pool.. so I really try to romanticise the good weather in Scotland when it\\u2019s here! \\ud83e\\udd70\\ud83c\\udff4\\udb40\\udc67\\udb40\\udc62\\udb40\\udc73\\udb40\\udc63\\udb40\\udc74\\udb40\\udc7f\\n\\nWe have LOTS of beach trips.. Brochan and I both love them, usually in the early evening when it\\u2019s a bit cooler (for him, it breaks my heart for me because I love the heat!) but there\\u2019s still some sun! \\u2600\\ufe0f \\n\\nI may not be in the pool playing mermaids.. but how INCREDIBLE is this wall mural! It\\u2019s just outside someone\\u2019s house and the more I look at it, the more in awe I am! \\u2665\\ufe0f\\n\\nI love how fiery my hair looks in the sun! \\n\\nWe\\u2019re enjoying ice cream galore.. it\\u2019s summer after all! \\ud83e\\udd70\\n\\nWhat\\u2019s your flavour? I think I\\u2019m boring!\\n\\nAs well as beach visits, we are fond of the p-a-r-k .. \\ud83d\\udc3e\\n\\nAs you know, I\\u2019m trying to read more, and I don\\u2019t know if you have these near you but community libraries! A fantastic idea! And honesty sheds.. we\\u2019re so lucky!\\n\\nbut it\\u2019s still Scotland, there\\u2019s still rainy days.. there\\u2019s still a big jacket on the dog walk rotation, and there\\u2019s still coffees \\u2665\\ufe0f\\ud83d\\udc3e\\n\\nWe just romanticise the rest! | ad Never trust a girl that\\u2019s who\\u2019s super excited about the salad bar.. I mean, what in the Wallace and Gromit..?! \\ud83d\\ude2c\\n\\nIt was fantastic though.. \\ud83d\\udc4c\\ud83c\\udffb\\n\\nThis was my first time at @estabulorestaurants and I had such a great night! I had no idea what to expect but it surpassed whatever I thought!\\n\\nGreat food, great atmosphere, and it\\u2019s in one of my favourite buildings in Aberdeen! \\u2665\\ufe0f\\n\\nOh, maybe should have mentioned that I\\u2019d be speaking Scottish Gaelic.. oops \\ud83c\\udff4\\udb40\\udc67\\udb40\\udc62\\udb40\\udc73\\udb40\\udc63\\udb40\\udc74\\udb40\\udc7f\\n\\n#gaelic #scotlandisnow #aberdeencity #aberdeen | A full Scottish Gaelic unboxing\\u2026 because why not? \\ud83e\\udd70\\ud83c\\udff4\\udb40\\udc67\\udb40\\udc62\\udb40\\udc73\\udb40\\udc63\\udb40\\udc74\\udb40\\udc7f\\n\\nad I got my hands on the new @vieve blush and I think Sorbet might already have stolen my heart! \\ud83c\\udf51\\ud83c\\udf38 It\\u2019s just the prettiest peachy pink and you know that this is exactly the kind of shade that I reach for every day!\\n\\nNow\\u2026 the other new shade, Malbec? \\ud83d\\udc40 I\\u2019m giving her some serious side eye. It\\u2019s such a stunning berry red, but as a super pale girl, I\\u2019m slightly intimidated! \\ud83d\\ude02 I have a feeling it would be either absolutely beautiful (which is where I\\u2019m leaning) or I\\u2019ll look like I\\u2019ve been in a scrap!\\n\\nThe good news is they\\u2019re both available in store and online from today. VIEVE is genuinely one of my favourite makeup brands, so I was veeerry excited to film this.\\n\\nAnd yes\\u2026 in Scottish Gaelic! Surprise? \\ud83e\\udd79 It\\u2019s definitely not perfect, but I hope it\\u2019s learner friendly enough, that\\u2019s my hope.. that you can pick up a few words along the way!\\n\\nD\\u00e8 do bheachd? What do you think of a full Gaelic video?\\n\\n#gaelic #vieve"]	\N	pending	2026-07-15 16:59:26.6284	0a3492dae1e3a40e6b17610cb81b8d4574394ed629ec9a8bf1bc2a6e2ee6fe9c40418063f9a5	Lauren Smith | Scottish Gaelic & Lifestyle 🌿	Lauren	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Instagram	@laurenrhiannon	https://www.instagram.com/laurenrhiannon/	113496	P0	生活方式	Snov | Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果	[Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果]\n达人画像: 生活方式与实用解决方案\n适配 Dola: ✓\nDola 核心场景: 生活场景【P0】\n推荐内容角度: 用真实生活问题演示 Dola 把信息整理成可执行步骤；健康、金融、法律和医疗内容只做知识解释与准备清单，不代替专业建议\n内容证据: I’m guilty of feeling as though I have failed summer because I’m not abroad, by a pool.. so I really try to romanticise the good weather in Scotland when it’s here! 🥰🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n\nWe have LOTS of beach trips.. Brochan and I both love them, usually in the early evening when it’s a bit cooler (for him, it breaks my heart for me because I love the heat!) but there’s still some sun! ☀️ \n\nI may not be in the pool playing mermaids.. but how INCREDIBLE is this wall mural! It’s just outside someone’s house and the more I look at it, the more in awe I am! ♥️\n\nI love how fiery my hair looks in the sun! \n\nWe’re enjoying ice cream galore.. it’s summer after all! 🥰\n\nWhat’s your flavour? I think I’m boring!\n\nAs well as beach visits, we are fond of the p-a-r-k .. 🐾\n\nAs you know, I’m trying to read more, and I don’t know if you have these near you but community libraries! A fantastic idea! And honesty sheds.. we’re so lucky!\n\nbut it’s still Scotland, there’s still rainy days.. there’s still a big jacket on the dog walk rotation, and there’s still coffees ♥️🐾\n\nWe just romanticise the rest! | ad Never trust a girl that’s who’s super excited about the salad bar.. I mean, what in the Wallace and Gromit..?! 😬\n\nIt was fantastic though.. 👌🏻\n\nThis was my first time at @estabulorestaurants and I had such a great night! I had no idea what to expect but it surpassed whatever I thought!\n\nGreat food, great atmosphere, and it’s in one of my favourite buildings in Aberdeen! ♥️\n\nOh, maybe should have mentioned that I’d be speaking Scottish Gaelic.. oops 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n\n#gaelic #scotlandisnow #aberdeencity #aberdeen | A full Scottish Gaelic unboxing… because why not? 🥰🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿\n\nad I got my hands on the new @vieve blush and I think Sorbet might already have stolen my heart! 🍑🌸 It’s just the prettiest peachy pink and you know that this is exactly the kind of shade that I reach for every day!\n\nNow… the other new shade, Malbec? 👀 I’m giving her some serious side eye. It’s such a stunning berry red, b