85	\N	Shannon Owens | Travel &amp; Hotel Creator UK	https://www.instagram.com/welshfoodie__/	info@welshfoodie.co.uk	35510	英国	旅游出行	["London being hotter than Thailand wasn\\u2019t on my 2026 bingo card \\u2600\\ufe0f\\ud83d\\udd76\\ufe0f | POV: Date night just got an upgrade\\u2026 \\ud83c\\udf7e\\u2668\\ufe0f\\n\\nI don\\u2019t think I\\u2019ve ever had more fun in London. Floating through Canary Wharf in a 38\\u00b0C hot tub, champagne in hand, while taking in the skyline\\u2026 this has to be one of the coolest experiences I\\u2019ve done.\\n\\n\\u2728 Self-drive hot tub boats\\n\\ud83c\\udf7e Bring your favourite drinks\\n\\u2668\\ufe0f Heated to 38\\u00b0C\\n\\ud83d\\udc65 Up to 8 people per boat\\n\\ud83d\\udcb0 From \\u00a345pp\\n\\ud83d\\udccdCanary Wharf, London\\n\\nWhether it\\u2019s a date night, birthday or just an excuse to round up your friends, this one deserves a spot on your summer bucket list.\\n\\nWho are you bringing with you?\\ud83d\\udc47\\n\\n#London #CanaryWharf #SkunaBoats #DateIdeas #LondonDateIdeas ThingsToDoInLondon SummerInLondon LondonLife BucketList CoupleGoals LondonAdventures VisitLondon WeekendVibes HotTubBoat ExploreLondon | Just found you one of Amsterdam\\u2019s only hotels with a private balcony\\u2026 and honestly, that sold it for me \\u2665\\ufe0f\\n\\nRight in the middle of the city, but still with your own little spot to sit with a coffee, a cocktail, or just people-watch above the Amsterdam chaos.\\n\\nThe Albus is such a good find if you want central, cute, and a room that feels a bit more special than the usual city hotel.\\n\\nSave this for your next Amsterdam trip \\ud83e\\udd0d\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd @the_albus_hotel \\n#AmsterdamHotel #AmsterdamStay #AmsterdamCityBreak #TheAlbusHotel #AmsterdamTravelGuide AmsterdamHotels WhereToStayInAmsterdam WelshFoodie TravelCreator LuxuryTravel"]	\N	in_conversation	2026-07-15 16:59:26.6284	4c72cbff244a48254a065af725a684c1649439862360df953d2212273ddfc3654bc6c0d095a5	Shannon Owens | Travel &amp; Hotel Creator UK	Shannon	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	Instagram	@welshfoodie__	https://www.instagram.com/welshfoodie__/	35510	P0	旅游出行	Snov | Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果	[Dola UK KOL Expansion 150 - 邮箱采集结果]\n达人画像: 生活方式与实用解决方案\n适配 Dola: ✓\nDola 核心场景: 生活场景【P0】\n推荐内容角度: 用真实生活问题演示 Dola 把信息整理成可执行步骤；健康、金融、法律和医疗内容只做知识解释与准备清单，不代替专业建议\n内容证据: London being hotter than Thailand wasn’t on my 2026 bingo card ☀️🕶️ | POV: Date night just got an upgrade… 🍾♨️\n\nI don’t think I’ve ever had more fun in London. Floating through Canary Wharf in a 38°C hot tub, champagne in hand, while taking in the skyline… this has to be one of the coolest experiences I’ve done.\n\n✨ Self-drive hot tub boats\n🍾 Bring your favourite drinks\n♨️ Heated to 38°C\n👥 Up to 8 people per boat\n💰 From £45pp\n📍Canary Wharf, London\n\nWhether it’s a date night, birthday or just an excuse to round up your friends, this one deserves a spot on your summer bucket list.\n\nWho are you bringing with you?👇\n\n#London #CanaryWharf #SkunaBoats #DateIdeas #LondonDateIdeas ThingsToDoInLondon SummerInLondon LondonLife BucketList CoupleGoals LondonAdventures VisitLondon WeekendVibes HotTubBoat ExploreLondon | Just found you one of Amsterdam’s only hotels with a private balcony… and honestly, that sold it for me ♥️\n\nRight in the middle of the city, but still with your own little spot to sit with a coffee, a cocktail, or just people-watch above the Amsterdam chaos.\n\nThe Albus is such a good find if you want central, cute, and a room that feels a bit more special than the usual city hotel.\n\nSave this for your next Amsterdam trip 🤍\n\n📍 @the_albus_hotel \n#AmsterdamHotel #AmsterdamStay #AmsterdamCityBreak #TheAlbusHotel #AmsterdamTravelGuide AmsterdamHotels WhereToStayInAmsterdam WelshFoodie TravelCreator LuxuryTravel\n语言: 英语\n10天平均浏览量: 287\n邮箱状态: 已获取\n邮箱来源: 公开主页简介\n采集状态: 成功\n采集时间: 2026-07-15 19:43:31\n来源链接: https://www.instagram.com/welshfoodie__/	40263689	Dola-UK-KOL-Expansion-150-2026-07-15	["40263689"]	\N	{"id"