16	16	inbound	graceugoekesiobi@outlook.com	unknown@snov.local	Re: ✨ Paid YouTube Collaboration with Dola	Hi Priscilla,\n\nThanks so much for reaching out, this sounds like a great fit and I’d love to collaborate on this.\n\nFor the full package outlined (1 dedicated YouTube video integration, 30-day link in bio, 90 days ads code, and usage rights), my rate is £1,500.\n\nHappy to jump on a call or continue over email to align on the script, key talking points, and delivery timeline once we’ve confirmed terms.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest,\n\nGrace\n\nFrom: Priscilla\n\nSent: Tuesday, 14 July 2026 09:00:40\n\nTo: graceugoekesiobi@outlook.com\n\nSubject: ✨ Paid YouTube Collaboration with Dola\n\nHi Grace,\n\nHope you're having a fantastic day!\n\nWe're reaching out from Richup Media on behalf of Dola\n\n(https://www.dola.com/). Dola is an all-in-one AI assistant\n\nby ByteDance — the parent company of TikTok — with features\n\nspanning conversational Q&A, image generation, document\n\nprocessing, code programming, and voice interaction.\n\nWe'd love to invite you to create a YouTube video showcasing\n\nDola's features and creative use cases. If you're interested\n\nin this collaboration, could you please share your rate based\n\non the following usage terms?\n\n✨ Collaboration\n\nBrand: https://www.dola.com/\n\nPlatform: YouTube\n\nDeliverables: 1 dedicated video integration + 30-day link\n\nin Bio + 90 Days Ads Code + Usage Rights\n\n✨ Production & Payment Terms\n\nScript: We will prepare and provide the script.\n\nVideo production support: We will provide video production\n\nassistance, including creative direction, key talking\n\npoints, demo flow, and reference materials when needed.\n\nVideo delivery: Please submit the video within 3 days after\n\nthe script is provided.\n\nBest,\n\nRichup Media	<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\r\n<span style="font-size: 12pt; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 91.35%;">Hi Priscilla,</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id="ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line" data-applydefaultfontstyles="true" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;" dir="ltr">\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\r\nThanks so much for reaching out, this sounds like a great fit and I’d love to collaborate on this.</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" dir="ltr">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\r\nFor the full package outlined (1 dedicated YouTube video integration, 30-day link in bio, 90 days ads code, and usage rights), my rate is £1,500.</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" dir="ltr">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\r\nHappy to jump on a call or continue over email to align on the script, key talking points, and delivery timeline once we’ve confirmed terms.</div>\r\n<div style="font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" dir="ltr">\r\n<br>\r\n</di