9	9	inbound	contact@aiwave.media	unknown@snov.local	Re: ✨ Paid Collaboration Opportunity with Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi	Hi Richup Media,\n\nThank you for reaching out and for considering AI Wave for your upcoming campaigns.\n\nI’d be interested in collaborating with Pippit, Dreamina, or Kimi, depending on the campaign fit and creative direction.\n\nFor my YouTube channel, my current rate is:\n\n1 dedicated YouTube video (5+ minutes): USD 1,200\n\nThe rate includes all production, service, platform, and transfer fees.\n\nAvailability: I have availability in July and can deliver the video within 7–10 days after receiving access to the product, the creative brief, and all required assets.\n\nIf my rate aligns with your budget, I’d be happy to review the campaign brief, discuss the deliverables, and move forward with the contract.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\n\nAI Wave\n\n---- On Tue, 14 Jul 2026 15:51:47 +0100 Tregenza wrote ----\n\nHi Ai,\n\nHope you're having a great day!\n\nWe're reaching out from Richup Media on behalf of several AI\n\nproduct teams to see if you'd be interested in a paid\n\ncollaboration.\n\nWe currently work closely with a few AI product lines,\n\nincluding Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi. Depending on the\n\ncampaign fit, the collaboration may focus on one of these\n\nproducts.\n\nPippit is an AI-powered content creation tool that helps\n\ncreators, sellers, and marketers produce high-quality\n\nmarketing content more efficiently. It supports AI video\n\ncreation, product content generation, smart editing, and\n\nready-to-use creative workflows, making it easier to turn\n\nproduct ideas and brand messages into polished social media\n\nassets.\n\nWe'd love to invite you to create content on your channel\n\nshowing how one or more of these products can be used in\n\nreal scenarios. We're happy to provide customized creative\n\nmaterials, demo flows, and key talking points to make the\n\nproduction process easier.\n\nIf you're open to this collaboration, could you please share\n\nyour rate card and availability for July?\n\n✨ Collaboration Details\n\nBrand: Pippit / Dreamina / Kimi\n\nPlatform: your channel\n\nPotential Deliverables:\n\n1 dedicated post or video post, 7-day paid usage rights, and\n\n7-day link in bio\n\n✨ Production & Payment Terms\n\nTimeline: July\n\nFull Brief and Creator Memo:\n\nWe'll share them once the collaboration is confirmed. Please\n\nsubmit the content within 3-5 days after the memo is provided.\n\nDeposit:\n\nA 10% deposit will be paid after the contract is signed. The\n\nremaining balance will be settled according to the agreed\n\nterms after final approval or publication.\n\nProduct Links:\n\nPippit: https://www.pippit.ai/\n\nDreamina: https://www.imagine.art/\n\nKimi: https://www.kimi.com/\n\nBest,\n\nRichup Media	<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN"><html><head><meta content="text/html;charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"></head><body ><div style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11pt;"><p style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px 'Times New Roman'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 19.00px; font-kerning: none">Hi Richup Media,</span><br></p><p style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px 'Times New Roman'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 19.00px; font-kerning: none">Thank you for reaching out and for considering AI Wave for your upcoming campaigns.</span><br></p><p style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px 'Times New Roman'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 19.00px; font-kerning: none">I’d be interested in collaborating with Pippit, Dreamina, or Kimi, depending on the campaign fit and creative direction.</span>