13	13	inbound	contact@zoetryai.com	unknown@snov.local	Re :quick question about a paid collab	Hi,\n\nThank you for your message and for considering a collaboration. I appreciate the opportunity and would be happy to explore working together.\n\nHere are my most flexible rates:\n\n* **Dedicated YouTube Video:** **$1,200**\n\n* **YouTube Integration (within a regular video):** **$1,000**\n\n* **YouTube Shorts / Short-form Content:** **$600**\n\nFor brands interested in a long-term partnership, I can also offer the following package:\n\n* **1 Dedicated YouTube Video + 1 YouTube Short:** **$1,300**\n\nI'm always open to building long-term partnerships when there's a good fit, and I'd be happy to discuss future collaborations if the first campaign performs well.\n\nLooking forward to hearing your thoughts.\n\nBest regards,\n\nZoetry AI\n\nDu: Micah\nÀ:\nDate: mar., 14 juil. 2026 14:53:13 +0100\nObjet: quick question about a paid collab\n\nHi Zoetry,\n\nHope you're having a great day!\n\nWe're reaching out from Richup Media to see if you're open to\n\na paid collaboration with AI products such as Pippit,\n\nDreamina, and Kimi.\n\nPippit is an AI-powered content creation tool for creators,\n\nsellers, and marketers. It helps generate product videos,\n\nmarketing content, social media creatives, and polished brand\n\nassets more efficiently.\n\nWe'd like to invite you to post content on your channel\n\nshowing how one of these products can be used in real\n\nscenarios.\n\nTo make this easier, our team can support with the script,\n\nediting, demo flow, creative direction, and reference\n\nmaterials. For faceless content, we could even handle most of\n\nthe video production, so you would mainly need to review and\n\npublish it on your channel. In that case, could you offer a\n\ndiscounted publishing-only rate?\n\nCould you please share your rate card and availability for\n\nJuly?\n\n✨ Collaboration Details\n\nBrand: Pippit / Dreamina / Kimi\n\nPlatform: your channel\n\nPoten