14	14	inbound	esmileaiofficial@gmail.com	unknown@snov.local	Re: quick question about a paid collab	Hi Chretien,\n\nThank you for reaching out and sharing the details about Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi!\n\nTo be completely transparent, my studio does not accept "publishing-only" deals, nor do we upload pre-produced, faceless content provided by third parties. To maintain high viewer retention and algorithmic trust with our core United States audience, every video on the Esmile AI channel is originally scripted, deeply researched, and professionally edited in-house.\n\nIf Richup Media is interested in a high-quality, authentic integration where I personally test and showcase one of these AI tools in a real workflow scenario, I would be happy to collaborate.\n\nFor a custom-produced campaign, my standard flat-fee rates are:\n* 1x Dedicated YouTube Video (Deep dive & full workflow) - $1,500 USD\n* 1x Integrated YouTube Video (60-90 seconds seamless integration) - $700 USD\n\nAdditionally, please note that for all new agency partnerships, our financial terms require a standard 50% upfront deposit routed securely through Wise, Payoneer, or direct local bank transfer before production begins.\n\nIf these production and payment terms align with your current campaign budget, please let me know which specific AI tool you would like to focus on first!\n\nBest regards,\n\nEsmile\nEsmile AI\n\nOn Tue, 14 Jul 2026 at 7:29 PM, Chretien wrote:\n\nHi Esmile,\n\nHope you're having a great day!\n\nWe're reaching out from Richup Media to see if you're open to\n\na paid collaboration with AI products such as Pippit,\n\nDreamina, and Kimi.\n\nPippit is an AI-powered content creation tool for creators,\n\nsellers, and marketers. It helps generate product videos,\n\nmarketing content, social media creatives, and polished brand\n\nassets more efficiently.\n\nWe'd like to invite you to post content on your channel\n\nshowing how one of these products can be used in real\n\nscenarios.\n\nTo mak