34	18	inbound	hello@uigradient.co	unknown@snov.local	Re:✨ Paid Collaboration Opportunity with Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi	Hi Richup Media team,\n\nThanks for reaching out! Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi all sound like fantastic tools that would highly resonate with my audience of UI/UX designers, creators, and tech professionals looking to optimize their workflow.\n\nI am open to a paid collaboration this July. To maximize your click-through rates and deliver the best results, here are my standard options integrated with comment automation:\n\nOption 1: Video Campaign (High Reach) - $2,000\n\n1 Dedicated Instagram Reel showing a real-world design/creative workflow using the selected tool (e.g., Pippit's AI video/smart editing features).\n\nManyChat automation setup (users comment a keyword, and your link is instantly DM'd to them—highly effective for driving conversions).\n\nOption 2: Deep-Dive Carousel (High Conversions) - $1,700\n\n1 Educational Carousel Post breaking down step-by-step how to use the tool, practical prompt formulas, or creative workflows.\n\nThe same automated DM trigger to convert engagement into direct traffic.\n\nTerms & Availability:\n\nAvailability: I have slots open to produce and publish this content in July.\n\nInclusions: The rates above include the requested 7-day link in bio and 7-day paid usage rights.\n\nPayment: The 10% deposit and payment terms work perfectly for me.\n\nLet me know which of the products you would like to prioritize first, and we can kick things off with the brief.\n\nLooking forward to working together!\n\nBest regards,\n\nVladimir\n\nCreator of @ui_gradient\n\nFrom: Sasa Fuu\nTo:\nDate: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 16:38:58 +0200\nSubject: ✨ Paid Collaboration Opportunity with Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi\n\nHi UI,\n\nHope you're having a great day!\n\nWe're reaching out from Richup Media on behalf of several AI\n\nproduct teams to see if you'd be interested in a paid\n\ncollaboration.\n\nWe currently work closely with a few AI product lines,\n\nincluding Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi. Depending on the\n\ncampaign fit, the collaboration may focus on one of these\n\nproducts.\n\nPippit is an AI-powered content creation tool that helps\n\ncreators, sellers, and marketers produce high-quality\n\nmarketing content more efficiently. It supports AI video\n\ncreation, product content generation, smart editing, and\n\nready-to-use creative workflows, making it easier to turn\n\nproduct ideas and brand messages into polished social media\n\nassets.\n\nWe'd love to invite you to create content on your channel\n\nshowing how one or more of these products can be used in\n\nreal scenarios. We're happy to provide customized creative\n\nmaterials, demo flows, and key talking points to make the\n\nproduction process easier.\n\nIf you're open to this collaboration, could you please share\n\nyour rate card and availability for July?\n\n✨ Collaboration Details\n\nBrand: Pippit / Dreamina / Kimi\n\nPlatform: your channel\n\nPotential Deliverables:\n\n1 dedicated post or video post, 7-day paid usage rights, and\n\n7-day link in bio\n\n✨ Production & Payment Terms\n\nTimeline: July\n\nFull Brief and Creator Memo:\n\nWe'll share them once the collaboration is confirmed. Please\n\nsubmit the content within 3-5 days after the memo is provided.\n\nDeposit:\n\nA 10% deposit will be paid after the contract is signed. The\n\nremaining balance will be settled according to the agreed\n\nterms after final approval or publication.\n\nProduct Links:\n\nPippit: https://www.pippit.ai/\n\nDreamina: https://www.imagine.art/\n\nKimi: https://www.kimi.com/\n\nBest,\n\nRichup Media	<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN"><html><head><meta content="text/html;charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"></head><body ><div style="font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"><p data-path-to-node="2">Hi Richup Media team,<br></p><p data-path-to-node="3">Thanks for reaching out! Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi all sound like fantastic tools that would highly resonate with my audience of UI/UX designers, creators, and tech professionals looking to optimize their workflow.<br></p><p data-path-to-node="4">I am open to a paid collaboration this July. To maximize your click-through rates and deliver the best results, here are my standard options integrated with comment automation:<br></p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="5,0,0">Option 1: Video Campaign (High Reach) - $2,000</b><br></p><ul data-path-to-node="5,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0" style="margin-top: 0px;">1 Dedicated Instagram Reel showing a real-world design/creative workflow using the selected tool (e.g., Pippit's AI video/smart editing features).<br></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,1,0" style="margin-top: 0px;">ManyChat automation setup (users comment a keyword, and your link is instantly DM'd to them—highly effective for driving conversions).<br></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="5,1,0">Option 2: Deep-Dive Carousel (High Conversions) - $1,700</b><br></p><ul data-path-to-node="5,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0" style="margin-top: 0px;">1 Educational Carousel Post breaking down step-by-step how to use the tool, practical prompt formulas, or creative workflows.<br></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1,1,0" style="margin-top: 0px;">The same automated DM trigger to convert engagement into direct traffic.<br></p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="6">Terms &amp; Availability:</b><br></p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="7,0,0">Availability:</b> I have slots open to produce and publish this content in July.<br></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="7,1,0">Inclusions:</b> The rates above include the requested <b data-index-in-node="50" data-path-to-node="7,1,0">7-day link in bio</b> and <b data-index-in-node="72" data-path-to-node="7,1,0">7-day paid usage rights</b>.<br></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><b data-index-in-node="0" data-path-to-node="7,2,0">Payment:</b> The 10% deposit and payment terms work perfectly for me.<br></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0" style="margin-top: 0px;"><br></p><p data-path-to-node="8">Let me know which of the products you would like to prioritize first, and we can kick things off with the brief.<br></p><p data-path-to-node="9"><br></p><div>Looking forward to working together!<br></div><p data-path-to-node="10"><br>Best regards,<br></p><p data-path-to-node="11">Vladimir<br></p><p data-path-to-node="12">Creator of @ui_gradient<br></p><div><br></div><div class="zmail_extra_hr" style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 0px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 0px;"><br></div><div class="zmail_extra" data-zbluepencil-ignore="true"><div><br></div><div id="Zm-_Id_-Sgn1">From: Sasa Fuu &lt;sasfafuu@gmail.com&gt;<br>To: &lt;hello@uigradient.co&gt;<br>Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 16:38:58 +0200<br>Subject: ✨ Paid Collaboration Opportunity with Pippit, Dreamina, and Kimi<br></div><div><br></div><blockquote id="blockquote_zmail" style="margin: 0px;"><div><table border="0"><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Hi UI<span></span>,<br></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Hope you're having a great day!<br></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 